        <detaileddescription>
<para>Execution pipeline:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Check <computeroutput>WASM_SANDBOX</computeroutput> feature flag → reject if disabled.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Reject empty blobs.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Reject blobs that exceed <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_w_a_s_m_kernel_sandbox_1_1_sandbox_config_1a07abc5c1682bbe462b2b51959fdd1f21" kindref="member">SandboxConfig::memory_limit_bytes</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Validate <computeroutput>kernel_id</computeroutput> + <computeroutput>blob</computeroutput> via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_kernel_validator" kindref="compound">GPUKernelValidator</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Execute in the WASM sandbox (or CPU simulation fallback).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Enforce <computeroutput>max_execution_ms</computeroutput> timeout; reject with REJECTED_TIMEOUT if the deadline is exceeded.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
